sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Api
    participant Db as Database
    User->>+Api: Fetch the profile
    Api->>+Db: Query
    Db-->>-Api: Rows
    Api-->>-User: Profile
    User->>+Api: Update the profile
    Api->>+Api: Validate
    Api-->>-Api: Valid
    Api->>+Db: Write
    Api->>+Db: Write the audit row
    Db-->>-Api: Written
    Db-->>-Api: Audited
    Api-->>-User: Saved
